From 479621f4d654be92f7816068dee1d8ecaf4a167f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 3 Jun 2026 15:50:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add mobile hamburger menu for sidebar and navigation

On small screens the sidebar and inline nav are now hidden behind a
sticky top bar with a hamburger button. Tapping it opens a slide-in
drawer containing the profile, page navigation (Papers, CV, etc.) and
social links. Language/theme toggles move into the top bar so they stay
reachable. Built entirely in the shared script.js/style.css, so every
page picks it up without per-page changes.
---
 script.js | 143 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 style.css | 171 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 304 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)

